          "message": "chore(main): release 3.2.27 (#1551)\n\n:robot: I have created a release *beep* *boop*\n---\n\n\n##\n[3.2.27](https://github.com/andymai/brepkit/compare/v3.2.26...v3.2.27)\n(2026-08-12)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **algo:** compare closed-curve directions by tangent, not parameter\nframe ([#1550](https://github.com/andymai/brepkit/issues/1550))\n([911e887](https://github.com/andymai/brepkit/commit/911e8877e55785d758a65d74604aca8790cbd6ac))\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [Release\nPlease](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please). See\n[documentation](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please#release-please).\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n---\n## Summary by cubic\nRelease 3.2.27 with a fix to closed-curve direction comparison using\ntangents for more reliable orientation on periodic curves. Includes\nworkspace version bumps; no API changes.\n\n- **Bug Fixes**\n- `brepkit-algo`: compare closed-curve directions by tangent, not\nparameter frame, to prevent false reversals.\n\n<sup>Written for commit 1b6e9f4482f7ec5a238055087e2a1e8a8ada409a.\nSummary will update on new commits.</sup>\n\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/andymai/brepkit/pull/1551?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\nCo-authored-by: brepkit[bot] <265643962+brepkit[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>",
